From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sapphire Port <sapphire@xiaomi>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:11:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 0353] sapphire: fix GPU pool leak (aggressive periodic reap + gemNew rescue + enhanced retry logic + diagnostic dump)

Major enhancements to gpool_alloc_with_reap():
1. Configurable retry count via boot arg sweet_gpu_alloc_retry (default 5)
2. Configurable base sleep via boot arg sweet_gpu_alloc_sleep_ms (default 2ms)
3. Exponential backoff: 2ms, 4ms, 8ms, 16ms, 32ms
4. Per-attempt logging: attempt#, pool_free_pages, fLeft_pending, fences_signaled
5. Full diagnostic dump on failure: GPU pool state + fLeft array + SMMU fault info
6. Force reap mode: if pool < 10% free, aggressively reap ALL clients

Also retains: 10ms periodic reap timer, clientClose cleanup, sysctl stats.

Signed-off-by: Sapphire Port <sapphire@xiaomi>
---
 iokit/Kernel/arm/SapphireGpu.cpp | 350 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 328 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

